From 04ab39da5c51efeb9597034549ebf61bf7162272 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gngpp <gngppz@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 17:03:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 06/11] boringssl: verify delegated credentials

Implement RFC 9345 TLS 1.3 client verification, including authorization, lifetime, signature, algorithm, alert, and session-expiry checks. Add deterministic positive and adversarial runner coverage.
